    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12808" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκερδαίνω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κεκέρδαγκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					43.18
				</span></i>
			<i>:—have benefit, enjoyment from</i> or
			<i>of</i> a thing, c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					432
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. βραχέα</span>
			<i>make</i> some small <i>gain</i> of a thing, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.134
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνεσται ἀποκερδᾶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMort.</u>
					4.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
